      <div class="card"><span class="card__tag">Ages 2 to 5</span><h3>Early Years</h3><p>Play-based days in English following the British EYFS framework. Stories, music, movement, sand, water. Short-term children settle in quickly because the days are predictable and warm.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="card__tag">Years 1 to 9 · half day</span><h3>Vocational half day</h3><p>For children who learn by doing. Cooking and nutrition, public speaking, creative play and innovation, PE and movement, art and design. Making, not sitting.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="card__tag">Years 1 to 9 · half day</span><h3>Academic half day</h3><p>Keep up with school while you are away. Cambridge English, Maths and Science in small classes, without committing to a full day.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="card__tag">Years 1 to 9 · full day</span><h3>Cambridge plus vocational, full day</h3><p>The whole PRA day: Cambridge core subjects in the morning and hands-on classes in the afternoon. This is what our regular students do.</p></div>
