<section class="faq">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <h2>Questions travelling families ask</h2>
    <details><summary>When can we start?</summary><p>Send us your dates and your child's age and we will tell you what is open. Stays run from three weeks (six weeks for the Lower Secondary academic and full-day pathways) to three months. Fees are paid in full before the first day, and weeks shortened by holidays are taken into account: see the <a href="{{ '/admissions/tuition-and-fees/' | url }}">fees page</a>.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Does my child need English?</summary><p>Not for Early Years or the vocational half day: every level of English is welcome. The academic half day and the full day need enough English to follow Cambridge lessons, and we decide case by case after meeting your child.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can we try a day first?</summary><p>Yes. A trial day costs 1,600,000 VND, meals included, for up to three days. If your child then joins, we take it off the fees.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Is lunch included?</summary><p>No, it is optional. Lunch and two snacks cost 75,000 VND a day in Early Years and 80,000 in Primary and Secondary, refundable with 15 days' notice.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>

